@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "End user\n(Browser)" as U
node "Frontend\nReact 18 + Vite\n(port 5173)" as FE
node "Backend API\nNode.js + Express 4\n(port 5000)" as BE
database "MongoDB\n(Mongoose 7)" as DB
cloud "OpenAI API\n(gpt-4o-mini)" as AI
database "Redis\n(optional cache)" as R
U --> FE : HTTPS/HTTP
FE --> BE : REST /api/* (JSON, JWT Bearer,\nX-Cart-Session header)
BE --> DB : queries / text index
BE --> AI : NLP extraction,\nchat completions
BE ..> R : cache (lazy connect,\ndisabled when unavailable)
@enduml